gametitle=Gran Turismo 3 A-spec - Papao Spec orbital camera v0.4 (PBPX-95503, 8AA991B0)

[Camera/Orbital nativa - analogico direito]
description=Standalone PNACH. X selects the horizontal angle up to 180 degrees per side; release returns smoothly. Y adjusts pitch. [ moves closer; ] moves farther. Original FOV. See README for bindings. Use one camera mod.
// Verified MIPS and float alignment; no heap allocation or helper.
// Initialize only with matching core signatures and an empty marker.
